The BEMC coverage of \(\eta\) x \(\phi\) = (0,1) x (-\(\pi\),\(\pi\)) includes some regions where towers or SMD strips were not operating properly, and either missing or corrupt in the recorded data. The operating configuration, and hence which channels were missing or corrupt, changed in time during the whole 2003 data taking. These channels reduce the detector's acceptance.

